research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log:13563:cor-injective-or-monotone-derivative-is-continuous	L1	thm-darboux-theorem-for-derivatives	Statement
research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-13564-FACT Every derivative has the intermediate value property ([[thm-darboux-theorem-for-derivatives]]).
research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-13565-QUOTE If $I\subseteq\mathbb R$ is an interval and $f:I\to\mathbb R$ is differentiable, then $f'$ has the intermediate value property ([[def-intermediate-value-property]]).
