research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-13568-FACT An injective Darboux function is strictly monotone ([[lem-injective-darboux-function-is-strictly-monotone]]).
research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-13569-QUOTE An injective function $f:I\to\mathbb R$ on an interval $I$ with the intermediate value property is strictly monotone.
