research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log:1133810:+{"id":"cor-injective-or-monotone-derivative-is-continuous","statement":"ai-altered","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"semantic-source","urls":["https://doiserbia.nb.rs/Article.aspx?id=1452-86302100024M","https://www.jirka.org/ra/html/sec_mvt.html"],"rationale":"The literature supplies the two standard ingredients: derivatives have the Darboux property, and injective Darboux functions are strictly monotone. The item packages those with the standard continuity theorem for monotone functions having interval image, and adds the already-monotone alternative.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
