research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-1348060-+{"id":"cor-taylor-remainder-bound","statement":"literature-derived","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"exact-source","urls":["https://myweb.uiowa.edu/pbreheny/7110/wiki/taylor-series.html"],"rationale":"The source states the standard Lagrange error estimate M|x-a|^{n+1}/(n+1)! under the same derivative bound. The repository's proof is a direct local application of its preceding remainder theorem.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
