research/audit/wave11-dispatch/audit-beta-a1a2.log-1448369-+{"id":"thm-second-derivative-test","statement":"literature-derived","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"exact-source","urls":["https://www.jirka.org/ra/html/sec_taylor.html"],"rationale":"The source gives the same pointwise second-derivative test: f'(c)=0 with positive or negative f''(c) yields a strict local minimum or maximum. The item proves it through derivative monotonicity under the same weak pointwise hypothesis.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
